    "whatItIs": "Homebase is an SMB frontline app for hourly scheduling, time clocks, team comms, and light hiring. Published per-location plans: Basic free (1 location, ≤10 employees); Essentials $30/$24 monthly vs annual; Plus $70/$56; All-in-One $120/$96 with unlimited employees on paid tiers. 14-day All-in-One trial. Payroll, tip manager, and hiring boosts are add-ons. Multi-site TCO is location-count, not headcount.",
